test.yaml:15:28: label "ubuntu-18.04" is unknown. GitHub retired it on 2023-04-03, so a job on it never gets a runner. use "ubuntu-24.04" or "ubuntu-26.04" instead (https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/6002). if it is a custom label for self-hosted runner, set list of labels in jactionlint.yaml config file [runner-label]
